{'symbol': 'INTU', 'date': '2022-12-19 09:00:00', 'title': 'CREDIT KARMA DONATES $75,000 TO GENONE TO HELP WITH COLLEGE AND CAREER-READINESS IN UNDER-SERVED AREAS OF CHARLOTTE', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--CREDIT KARMA, A CONSUMER FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY COMPANY WITH NEARLY 130 MILLION MEMBERS, HAS TEAMED UP WITH GENONE CHARLOTTE, A LOCAL NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION WHO WORKS WITH TALENTED FIRST-GENERATION COLLEGE STUDENTS FROM UNDER-SERVED CHARLOTTE COMMUNITIES, HELPING THEM SUCCESSFULLY NAVIGATE TO AND THROUGH COLLEGE. WITH THIS DONATION, GENONE WILL BE ABLE TO TRIPLE THE NUMBER OF STUDENTS THEY SUPPORT OVER THE NEXT THREE YEARS. IN ADDITION TO THE MONETARY DONATION, CREDIT KARMA PLANS TO PARTNER WITH GENONE TO CREATE A CAREER PATHWAYS ROTATIONAL INTERNSHIP AT THEIR CHARLOTTE HEADQUARTERS FOR GENONE STUDENTS WHO ARE ENTERING THEIR SOPHOMORE YEAR OF COLLEGE.'}